 between our countries, Latvian government offers three types of scholarships to Korean students, researchers and summer school participants for the academic year of 2018/2019: <o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Scholarships for studies at Latvian Higher Education Institutions (1 year bachelor’s, master’s or PhD studies, application deadline 1 April 2018);<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Fellowships for research work in Latvian Higher Education Institutions (for academic staff up to 5 months, application deadline 1 April 2018);<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Scholarships for participation in summer schools in Latvia in 2017 (application deadline 4 May 2018).<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">The Applications are open at the Latvian State Education Development Agency website here: </font><a href=\"http://www.viaa.gov.lv/scholarships\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">www.viaa.gov.lv/scholarships</font></u></a><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\">.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">The Embassy would like to kindly ask to spread this information among your university students and academic staff.<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">For details, please refer to the files enclosed:<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">- (Korean) Detailed information on Latvian scholarships for the academic year 2018/2019 (7 pages)<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">- (English) Detailed information on Latvian scholarships for the academic year 2018/2019 (5 pages)<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">- (Korean) Brief information about Latvia (1 page).<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"Calibri\">For inquiries:<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">Latvian State Education Development Agency </font><a href=\"mailto:scholarships@viaa.gov.lv\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">scholarships@viaa.gov.lv</font></u></a><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"> (English/Latvian)<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">Latvian Embassy in Seoul: </font><a href=\"mailto:embassy.seoul@mfa.gov.lv\"><u><font color=\"#0563c1\" size=\"3\" face=\"Calibri\">embassy.seoul@mfa.gov.lv</font></u></a><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font face=\"Calibri\"> (English/Korean/Latvian)<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><span lang=\"LV\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: LV\"><font face=\"Calibri\"><font color=\"#000000\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></font></font></font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\